{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar 11.6.21 — Judge.me review carousel, brought into the house system.

  The app block ships with black text, a grey card and Judge.me's default
  star colour, which reads as a third-party widget dropped onto the page.
  Colour, copy and the empty media well are fixed in the block's own settings
  (templates/index.json); this file is the layout and typography pass that
  those settings cannot reach.

  Everything is scoped to the section id of the app block on the home page,
  so no other Judge.me widget — the product page badge, the review widget —
  is touched. Selectors are written against Judge.me's jdgm- class names with
  substring fallbacks, because the markup is the app's and can change under
  us; if a selector stops matching, the block simply falls back to Judge.me's
  own styling rather than breaking.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style id="besjaar-reviews-1171">
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756{padding:clamp(30px,5vw,60px) 0}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="jdgm-carousel"]{--bj-r-line:rgba(21,50,82,.12)}

/* Heading: section type, not app type. */
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="jdgm-carousel-title"],
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="jdgm-carousel__title"]{margin:0 0 12px!important;color:#0F2947!important;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,4.2vw,2rem)!important;font-weight:600!important;line-height:1.14!important;letter-spacing:-.025em!important;text-transform:none!important}

/* Rating summary row sits calmly under it. */
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="jdgm-carousel"] [class*="rating"]{display:inline-flex!important;align-items:center!important;flex-wrap:wrap!important;gap:8px!important;margin-bottom:22px!important;font-size:.9rem!important}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 .jdgm-star{color:#D79545!important}

/* Cards: white, hairline, calm. */
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"]{box-sizing:border-box!important;display:flex!important;flex-direction:column!important;gap:8px!important;padding:18px 20px!important;border:1px solid var(--bj-r-line,rgba(21,50,82,.12))!important;border-radius:16px!important;background:#FFFFFF!important;box-shadow:none!important;transition:box-shadow .2s ease,transform .2s ease}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"]:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(15,41,71,.08)!important}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"] [class*="review-title"]{color:#0F2947!important;font-size:.95rem!important;font-weight:600!important;letter-spacing:-.01em!important}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"] [class*="review-body"],
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"] [class*="__review"]{color:#49627D!important;font-size:.88rem!important;line-height:1.55!important}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="reviewer-name"]{color:#0F2947!important;font-size:.8rem!important;font-weight:600!important}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="product-title"]{color:#49627D!important;font-size:.75rem!important;line-height:1.4!important}

/* Arrows as real buttons instead of bare chevrons. */
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="arrow"]{display:inline-flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;width:40px!important;height:40px!important;border:1px solid var(--bj-r-line,rgba(21,50,82,.12))!important;border-radius:50%!important;background:#FFFFFF!important;color:#153252!important;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(15,41,71,.06)!important;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease}
#shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="arrow"]:hover{background:#153252!important;color:#FFFFFF!important}

@media (max-width:640px){
  #shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="carousel-item"]{padding:16px!important;border-radius:14px!important}
  #shopify-section-17881022079efec756 [class*="arrow"]{width:36px!important;height:36px!important}
}
</style>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Besjaar review polish",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "11.6.21: restyles the Judge.me cards carousel on the home page to the Besjaar type and colour system — section-weight heading, hairline white cards, gold stars, circular arrows. Scoped to that one block, so other Judge.me widgets are untouched. Keep in the header group."
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
